    "**Research Challenges:**\n",
    "- **Fidelity selection**: Choosing optimal simulation levels\n",
    "- **Error propagation**: Managing uncertainty across fidelity levels\n",
    "- **Optimization strategies**: Where to allocate computational budget\n",
    "- **Model architecture**: Best structures for multi-fidelity integration"
